# Input

```jsx
a = <div {...{/* comment */}} />;
b = <div {...{/* a */ /* b */}} />;
c = <div {...[/* comment */]} />;
d = <div {...(class {/* comment */})} />;
e = <div>{...{/* comment */}}</div>;
f = <div>{...[/* comment */]}</div>;
g = <div {...{}} />;

```


